  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline SUPER TORO is a six-sided co-polyester designed around surgical precision, controllable power and heavy spin. Its sharp hexagonal edges grip the ball aggressively, while the controlled response helps players redirect pace and take full swings without fear of overhitting. Toroline positions SUPER TORO as a highly connected string that feels like an extension of the player's arm, making it particularly suitable for advanced players who want to dictate points through precision, spin and confident directional control.",

    "zh": "Toroline SUPER TORO 是一款以 Surgical Precision、Controllable Power 和 Heavy Spin 为核心的六边形共聚酯球线。锐利的六边形边缘能够牢牢抓住网球并制造大量旋转，同时整体力量输出保持高度可控，让球员可以放心完成完整挥拍，而不必过度担心击球过深。它特别强调 Connected Feel 和 Shot Redirection，Toroline 将这种反馈描述为球线仿佛成为手臂的延伸，因此非常适合希望通过精准落点、改变来球方向和主动控制比赛节奏的高级球员。"
  },

